              <div class="banner_title" style="background-image: url(/sites/default/files/styles/page_banner/public/media/2020-01/participantes_como_hacerse_participante_751358878b.jpg?itok=AqryRSEh);">
                <div id="block-omiclear-page-title" class="block block-core block-page-title-block">
  
    
      
  <h1 class="page-title"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">How to become a participant</span>
</h1>


  </div>

              </div>
            </div>
          
            <div class="region region-content">
    <div id="block-omiclear-content" class="block block-system block-system-main-block">
  
    
      
<div class="node node--type-cc-content node--view-mode-full">

  
    
    <div class="node__content">
      
      <div class="field field--name-field-cc-section field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="section accordion-tabs clearfix ac-accordian field__item" data-title="true" data-subtitle="false" data-colors="default" style="margin-bottom:35px;" id="section-0">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--accordion-tabs paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="h2 center">Admission Process</div></div>
      
      <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--cc-accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Registration Agent</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-cc-at-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><ul>
	<li><strong>Role Description:</strong></li>
</ul>

<p>Participant with access to a trading platform connected with OMIClear (eg. Trading Member of OMIP), being capable to register trades in OMIClear for its clearing and settlement.</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Eligible Entities:</strong></li>
</ul>

<p>Legal person authorized to operate in OMIClear’s Service on Power Derivatives Contracts and /or the Service on Natural Gas Derivatives Contracts.</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Required Information:</strong></li>
</ul>

<p>To assume the role of Registration Agent (RAg) the applicant shall provide the following information to OMIClear:</p>
<img alt="registration agent" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="bdec9259-265e-4683-b536-8e20b01e1c19" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/new_membership_omiclear.png" class="align-center" width="598" height="614" loading="lazy">
<p>&nbsp;</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Membership roadmap:</strong></li>
</ul>
<img alt="Membership roadmap" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="82754a44-6cd7-4e8e-bb7e-05467c544931" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/new_membership_omiclear_1.png" class="align-center" width="679" height="592" loading="lazy">
<p>&nbsp;</p></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--cc-accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Direct Clearing Member</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-cc-at-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><ul>
	<li><strong>Role Description:</strong></li>
</ul>

<p>Buying or selling counterparty of every position that is registered in OMIClear on own account and/or entities in a control or company group relationship.</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Minimum Capital and Risk &nbsp;Requisites: </strong></li>
</ul>

<p>Please see OMIClear’s Instruction B02/2014 - Requirements for Clearing Members (OMIClear’s Instructions are available for download&nbsp;<a data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="bdc09fc4-eb4a-486f-a21e-ac3207a5a3cf" href="/sites/default/files/inline-files/omiclear_instructions.zip">here</a>).</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Eligible Entities:</strong></li>
</ul>

<p>- Qualified investors, as defined in paragraph (1)(a) to (h) of Article 30 of the Portuguese Securities Code;</p>

<p>- Entities of the Energy Sector.</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Required Information: </strong></li>
</ul>

<p>To assume the role of Direct Clearing Member (DCM) the applicant shall provide the following information to OMIClear:</p>
<img alt="Required Information" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="b65a4a59-76c1-4430-888e-2a997a7653de" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/new_membership_omiclear_2.png" class="align-center" width="594" height="641" loading="lazy">
<p>&nbsp;</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Membership roadmap:</strong></li>
</ul>
<img alt="Membership roadmap" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="6a326d16-8fc7-49b1-a235-36f9ab8939c6" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/new_membership_omiclear_3.png" class="align-center" width="656" height="598" loading="lazy"></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--cc-accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">General Clearing Member</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-cc-at-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><ul>
	<li><strong>Role Description: </strong></li>
</ul>

<p>Buying or selling counterparty of every position that is registered in OMIClear on own account and/or third party account.</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Minimum Capital and Risk &nbsp;Requisites:</strong></li>
</ul>

<p>Please see OMIClear’s Instruction B02/2014 - Requirements for Clearing Members (OMIClear’s Instructions are available for download <a data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="f1a9c0fa-2682-4670-bfd1-566a5ec21f13" href="/sites/default/files/inline-files/omiclear_instructions_0.zip">here</a>).</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Eligible Entities:</strong></li>
</ul>

<p>- Credit institutions;</p>

<p>- Financial intermediaries.</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Required Information: </strong></li>
</ul>

<p>To assume the role of General Clearing Member (GCM) the applicant shall provide the following information to OMIClear:</p>
<img alt="General clearing member table" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="3e867290-3131-424e-b88f-03c9671ce886" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/new_membership_omiclear_1_0.png" class="align-center" width="611" height="661" loading="lazy">
<p>&nbsp;</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Membership roadmap:</strong></li>
</ul>
<img alt="General clearing member" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="3797d55b-b1c2-48ed-b7a6-4bf69250f375" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/new_membership_omiclear_0.png" class="align-center" width="642" height="596" loading="lazy">
<p>&nbsp;</p></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--cc-accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Financial Settlement Agent</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-cc-at-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><ul>
	<li><strong>Role Description: </strong></li>
</ul>

<p>Cash settlements of the positions registered in OMIClear on own account or on behalf of Clearing Members with which it has signed a financial settlement agreement.</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Eligible Entities: </strong></li>
</ul>

<p>Credit institutions &nbsp;that participate in the TARGET2 Settlement System as Direct Participants, Indirect Participants or BIC Addressees.</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Required Information</strong>:</li>
</ul>

<p>To assume the role of Financial Settlement Agent (FSAg) the applicant shall provide the following information to OMIClear:</p>
<img alt="Financial settlement agent_table" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="954794a2-dca7-4ed1-88af-74ddf085916c" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/new_membership_omiclear_2_0.png" class="align-center" width="594" height="422" loading="lazy">
<p>&nbsp;</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Membership roadmap:</strong></li>
</ul>
<img alt="membership_omiclear_Finacial" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="ee58c6ef-d77d-442f-a8f8-76eb9cc3e1b9" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/new_membership_omiclear_3_0.png" class="align-center" width="699" height="609" loading="lazy">
<p>&nbsp;</p></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--cc-accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Power Physical Settlement Agent</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-cc-at-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><ul>
	<li><strong>Role Description:</strong></li>
</ul>

<p>Physical delivery (assuming buy/sell orders at OMIE spot market) for own account or on behalf of clients holding physical power &nbsp;registration accounts with which it has signed a power physical settlement agreement.</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Eligible Entities:</strong></li>
</ul>

<p>- ‘Market Agents’ on the power spot market managed by OMIE;</p>

<p>- Entities holding power physical settlement accounts at OMIClear that are univocally associated with ‘<em>UCPs – Unidades de Contratación a Plazo</em>’ at OMIE, according with the specific rules of this spot market.</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Required Information:</strong></li>
</ul>

<p>To assume the role of Power Physical Settlement Agent (PSAg) the applicant shall provide the following information to OMIClear:</p>
<img alt="Power physical" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="909c2efc-4d74-4ac6-bcbc-e4710ee1ee94" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/new_membership_omiclear_4.png" class="align-center" width="610" height="337" loading="lazy">
<p>&nbsp;</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Membership roadmap:</strong></li>
</ul>
<img alt="membership roadmap_physical" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="9da9063f-786e-43c3-a8a4-0c22f63e4d90" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/new_membership_omiclear_5.png" class="align-center" width="631" height="611" loading="lazy">
<p>&nbsp;</p></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--cc-accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Natural Gas Physical Settlement Agent</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-cc-at-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><ul>
	<li><strong>Role Description: </strong></li>
</ul>

<p>Perform the physical delivery (assuming buy/sell ‘title of transfers’ at the PVB-ES Spanish virtual trading point) for own account or on behalf of clients holding physical natural gas registration accounts with which it has signed a natural gas physical settlement agreement.</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Eligible Entities:</strong></li>
</ul>

<p>- Network Users (‘Sujeitos Habilitados’) at Enagás GTS;</p>

<p>- Entities holding natural gas physical settlement accounts at OMIClear that are associated with a network account (‘cartera de balance’) at the PVB-ES, according to the Spanish regulation.</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Required Information: </strong></li>
</ul>

<p>To assume the role of Natural Gas Physical Settlement Agent (PSAg) the applicant shall provide the following information to OMIClear:</p>
<img alt="natural gas" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="18da8e22-33a6-40f7-bcbb-0d9d7ad2cd11" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/new_membership_omiclear_6.png" class="align-center" width="600" height="339" loading="lazy">
<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Membership roadmap:</strong></li>
</ul>
<img alt="Membership_Natural gas" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="45246e42-e7ef-4f26-ba0d-1b63c21f31a5" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/new_membership_omiclear_7.png" class="align-center" width="686" height="612" loading="lazy">
<p>&nbsp;</p></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
          </div>
  
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="section accordion-tabs clearfix ac-tabs field__item" data-title="false" data-subtitle="false" data-colors="default" style="margin-bottom:70px;" id="section-1">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--accordion-tabs paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
      <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--cc-accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">OMIClear’s Membership Support</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-cc-at-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><ul>
	<li>The Marketing Department of OMIClear provides close support throughout the membership process.</li>
	<li>The complete set of forms and other useful information applicable to each type of membership is provided by the Marketing Department to the applicant.</li>
	<li>Marketing Department contacts are available <a href="/en/form/contacto-omiclear">here</a>.</li>
</ul></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--cc-accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Forms</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-cc-at-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Membership forms are available <a href="/sites/default/files/Forms_membership_ENG_202404.zip" data-entity-uuid="2af7b889-014c-4af6-b195-e870dc7864ff" data-entity-type="file">here</a>.</p></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="center paragraph paragraph--type--cc-accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-cc-at-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Fees</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-cc-at-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>The Admission and Maintenance Fees regarding each membership are published in OMIClear's Price List.</p></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
          </div>
  <div class="tabs"><ul><li><a href="#paragraph-650">OMIClear’s Membership Support</a></li><li><a href="#paragraph-651">Forms</a></li><li><a href="#paragraph-652">Fees</a></li></ul><div id="paragraph-650"><ul>
	<li>The Marketing Department of OMIClear provides close support throughout the membership process.</li>
	<li>The complete set of forms and other useful information applicable to each type of membership is provided by the Marketing Department to the applicant.</li>
	<li>Marketing Department contacts are available <a href="/en/form/contacto-omiclear">here</a>.</li>
</ul>
</div><div id="paragraph-651"><p>Membership forms are available <a href="/sites/default/files/Forms_membership_ENG_202404.zip" data-entity-uuid="2af7b889-014c-4af6-b195-e870dc7864ff" data-entity-type="file">here</a>.</p></div><div id="paragraph-652"><p>The Admission and Maintenance Fees regarding each membership are published in OMIClear's Price List.</p></div></div>
      </div>
</div>
